1. Definitions

“Software” means the source code, object code, documentation, assets, and other
materials distributed with this license.

“Modified Version” means any work derived from or based on the Software.

“Standalone Plugin Distribution” means a distribution in which the Software or
a Modified Version remains identifiable and usable primarily as an FFXIV ACT
plugin, whether distributed alone or bundled with other files.

“Integrated Product” means an independently developed product that contains the
Software or a Modified Version but provides substantial functionality separate
from the plugin. Merely renaming, rebranding, repackaging, bundling, or making
minor changes does not create an Integrated Product.

“Plugin Access Fee” means any mandatory payment, subscription, license fee,
activation fee, purchase, paid membership, credit, token, donation, or other
consideration required to download, install, activate, update, or use the
Software or a Modified Version as a plugin.

2. Copyright License

Subject to this license, each recipient is granted a worldwide, royalty-free,
non-exclusive, non-transferable license to:

a. use, reproduce, study, and modify the Software;
b. create Modified Versions;
c. distribute the Software or Modified Versions as a Standalone Plugin
   Distribution free of charge;
d. include the Software or Modified Versions in an Integrated Product,
   including a commercial or proprietary Integrated Product;
e. solicit and accept voluntary donations or sponsorships; and
f. charge for installation, customization, integration, training, maintenance,
   or technical support services.

No source-code disclosure obligation is imposed on code that is independent of
the Software. This license does not require a distributor of a Modified Version
to publish its source code.

3. Conditions

Every copy or substantial portion of the Software, including every Modified
Version, must:

a. retain the above copyright notice and this complete license text;
b. identify material modifications and their author or distributor;
c. state that it is modified and is not an official release when applicable;
   and
d. when distributed as a Standalone Plugin Distribution, be made available
   without a Plugin Access Fee.

A person charging for services under Section 2(f) must clearly separate the
service fee from the plugin and must either provide the plugin itself free of
charge or provide a no-charge download location. Payment for services must not
be required to receive or continue using the plugin.

4. Prohibited Conduct

You may not:

a. sell, license for a fee, rent, or otherwise monetize a Standalone Plugin
   Distribution;
b. impose a Plugin Access Fee or place plugin download, installation,
   activation, updates, or use behind a paywall;
c. evade this license by renaming, rebranding, repackaging, bundling, or making
   only minor changes to the Software;
d. remove, obscure, or misrepresent copyright, attribution, modification, or
   license notices;
e. claim that a Modified Version is an official release or is endorsed by the
   copyright holder without written permission; or
f. require a donation or sponsorship as a condition of access.

5. Integrated Products

An Integrated Product may be sold, subscribed to, or otherwise commercially
distributed. The independent portions of an Integrated Product may be licensed
under different terms. However, the commercial transaction must be for the
Integrated Product's substantial independent functionality and must not be a
pretext for charging for a Standalone Plugin Distribution.

The copyright and license notices required by Section 3 must remain accessible
in the Integrated Product's documentation, notices, about screen, or source
distribution, as appropriate.

